309
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:05,440
After all, I don't have
forehead wrinkles.

310
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,800
Neither of you has them?

311
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:07,840
I do.

312
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:08,120
I do.

313
