Rascal.

370
00:12:12,760 --> 00:12:15,120
You rascal.

371
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,200
You rascal.

372
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:18,240
Something feels off.

373
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:20,080
