386
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:42,840
Weirdo Lad.

387
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:46,080
Your nicknames
are totally straightforward.

388
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:47,200
Let me tell you.

389
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,160
We once

